  "_sizing_note": "Sized 2026-09-06 for $34.68 on the xyz HIP-3 dex, HIP-3 ONLY (enable_hip3 true, enable_crypto false). equity_fraction_per_trade 0.35 x 1x leverage = ~$12.14 per trade, clipped to $12 by each book's strategy_book_notional ceiling. max_concurrent 2 -> $24 deployed of $31.21 usable. $1.80 risk per trade at the 15% stop. WHY 0.35 AND NOT 0.1: the books override leverage to 1x, so the old 0.1 sized every trade at $3.47 \u2014 under HL MIN_ORDER_USD ($10.50) \u2014 and nothing could fill. strategy_book_notional is a ceiling, not a target. min_tradable_equity_usd 26 doubles as a drawdown brake. social_trending and unlock_short_runin produce ZERO xyz signals and will not trade while enable_crypto is false; their recorders keep writing the forward ledger, so their evidence still accrues.",
